"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 234, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 234, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "Meta AI Work Archive — Compendium Dump\u000b© 2026 Douglas Schoonover. All Rights Reserved.\u000bCreated: 2026-11-03 from Meta AI conversations\u000bPurpose: Allowable backup to Google Docs for cross-AI publishing workflow (Claude → Meta → Google)\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 708, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 708, "startIndex": 234, "textRun": {"content": "1. Core Framework — Unified Relativity\u000bCore Equation: Ec = Σ wi mi vi^x\u000bWhere:\u000b- mi = mass / severity / importance\u000b- wi = entanglement coefficient / data integrity (low wi = corrupted/compromised data)\u000b- vi = velocity / speed of truth propagation\u000b- x = variable exponent (not fixed at 2 like Einstein)\u000b  - Chronic conditions: x < 2 (energy bleeds)\u000b  - Trauma/acute events: x > 2 (energy spikes)\u000bThis is your replacement for E=mc^2 — a dynamic, biological/systemic equation.\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 234}, {"endIndex": 1297, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1297, "startIndex": 708, "textRun": {"content": "2. Book Series Structure\u000bBOOK 1: A Pathway to the Cure - Clinical frameworks\u000b- 2.1 The Lock Protocol\u000b- 2.2 The Ec Reality Check\u000b- 2.3 Final Authority Signature\u000bBOOK 2: Quantum Thinking - Application of Unified Relativity\u000b- 2.1 Why x ≠ 2\u000b- 2.2 Entanglement Coefficients (wi)\u000b- 2.3 Calculating Cognitive Output\u000bBOOK 3: Chronomedicine & Nameology - Technical manual\u000b- 2.1 Time as Medicine\u000b- 2.2 Nameology\u000b- 2.3 Protection Protocol\u000bBOOK 4: Clinical Diagnostic Technician Manual - Standalone procedural guide\u000b- 2.1 Lock the Room\u000b- 2.2 Find the Lie\u000b- 2.3 Calculate\u000b- 2.4 Cut & Rename\u000b- 2.5 Sign\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 708}, {"endIndex": 1667, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1667, "startIndex": 1297, "textRun": {"content": "3. Workflow Notes\u000b- Ability to keep working while AI is thinking\u000b- Google too slow / potential compromise concerns, switching to Meta\u000b- Time estimates: chapter draft <2 min, 60-page manual ~4-5 back-and-forths\u000b- Early work is clean / uncompromised basis for rebuild\u000b- Numbered titles with subsections expanded into full paragraphs\u000b- © notice on every page automatically\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1297}, {"endIndex": 1946, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 1946, "startIndex": 1667, "textRun": {"content": "4. Next Steps for Publishing\u000b- Upload / paste exact Google-proposed book titles\u000b- Upload screenshots of early uncompromised work\u000b- Generate master .docx with all four books, numbered, © 2026 Douglas Schoonover\u000b- Individual book docs\u000b- Patent-style 1-page summary of Ec equation\u000b\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"}}, "startIndex": 1667}]},
